{"id":"659508","name":"糖醋巴沙鱼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659508/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"巴沙鱼","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"巴沙鱼柳洗净后改刀切块。","img":"images/659508/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入胡椒粉抓拌均匀腌个底味。","img":"images/659508/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉和鸡蛋。","img":"images/659508/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"抓拌均匀备用。","img":"images/659508/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入巴沙鱼。","img":"images/659508/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炸至金黄后再捞出复炸。","img":"images/659508/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"碗中加入糖醋汁，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/659508/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中底油倒入调好的糖醋汁，大火煮开至浓稠。","img":"images/659508/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入炸好的巴沙鱼。","img":"images/659508/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀。","img":"images/659508/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"洒上白芝麻即可出锅。","img":"images/659508/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659508/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659508/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}